  fileContents: "Datalog 4: \r\nMessage from Colt Erin to lead developer Dr. [Corrupted]:\r\nThe publicity from your last interview is getting our investors anxious. \r\nYour talk of protections and guardrails to limit the potential of our machines was not a smart move. Critics always have something to say regardless of what we do. They are of no concern. I expect you to have these \u2018safeguards\u2019 removed asap and keep it quiet. We don\u2019t need government agents putting their nose where it doesn\u2019t belong.  "
